blocks.body:
Suppose \(K\) is a preconnected \(T_2\) space and:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item \(D\) is compact and nonempty, with \(U \subseteq D\);
  \item \(\pi\) is continuous on \(D\);
  \item \textbf{(collar, crux B)} every \(x \in D\) has an interior representative
        in its fibre: \(\exists\, y \in U,\ \pi(y) = \pi(x)\);
  \item \textbf{(local openness)} for every \(x \in U\), the set \(\pi(U)\) is a
        neighbourhood of \(\pi(x)\).
\end{enumerate}
Then \(\pi(U) = K\): the interior solutions surject onto the whole parameter
space.

lean.code:
def collarInterior [NeZero n] (S : Set (ZMod n → ℝ)) :
    Set ((ZMod n → ℝ) × (ZMod n → ℝ)) :=
  {p | p.1 ∈ S ∧ ModerateArc 0 p.1 p.2 ∧ closureMapR3 p = 0}
